# Graphics/GPU is off in the base zone kernel. Zones get their console over
# serial/hvc/virtio-console, not a framebuffer. The vendor fragments
# (zone-amdgpu, zone-nvidiagpu) re-enable the stack they need on top of this.
#
# Only prompted symbols are listed; the helper symbols under them have no
# prompt and follow automatically once these are off.
# CONFIG_ACPI_VIDEO is not set
# CONFIG_AGP is not set
# CONFIG_BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE is not set
# CONFIG_DRM is not set
# CONFIG_FB is not set
# CONFIG_VGA_CONSOLE is not set
